# Rust build output for `apps/model-explorer/rust/`. `target/` is also
# covered by the workspace-root `.gitignore` but we mirror it locally for the
# case where contributors run cargo from within this directory in isolation.
target/
# Library workspaces typically don't track their lockfile; skip it so the
# sidebar can choose when to refresh dependencies.
Cargo.lock
# Operator-local tantivy index cache. `seed build` populates this directory
# by default; contributors regenerate it on demand. Never commit the cache.
hwledger-index/
